<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>PETSAFE | Smart Pet Safety Identity</title>

<style>
*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
}

html{
    scroll-behavior:smooth;
}

body{
    background:#050b09;
    color:#fff;
    overflow-x:hidden;
}

body::before{
    content:"";
    position:fixed;
    inset:0;
    background:
        linear-gradient(rgba(80,255,180,.035) 1px,transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(80,255,180,.035) 1px,transparent 1px);
    background-size:45px 45px;
    pointer-events:none;
    z-index:-2;
}

body::after{
    content:"";
    position:fixed;
    width:700px;
    height:700px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:rgba(80,255,180,.06);
    filter:blur(110px);
    top:-300px;
    left:50%;
    transform:translateX(-50%);
    pointer-events:none;
    z-index:-3;
}

nav{
    position:sticky;
    top:0;
    z-index:100;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    padding:18px 7%;
    background:rgba(5,11,9,.84);
    backdrop-filter:blur(15px);
    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(80,255,180,.15);
}

.logo{
    font-size:22px;
    font-weight:800;
    letter-spacing:2px;
    color:#62ffb0;
}

nav a{
    color:#9baaa2;
    text-decoration:none;
    margin-left:25px;
    font-size:13px;
    transition:.3s;
}

nav a:hover{
    color:#62ffb0;
}

.hero{
    min-height:90vh;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    text-align:center;
    padding:80px 7%;
}

.hero-content{
    max-width:950px;
}

.badge{
    display:inline-block;
    padding:8px 18px;
    border:1px solid #62ffb0;
    border-radius:30px;
    color:#62ffb0;
    font-size:12px;
    letter-spacing:2px;
    margin-bottom:25px;
}

h1{
    font-size:clamp(55px,10vw,110px);
    letter-spacing:7px;
    line-height:.95;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff,#62ffb0,#fff);
    -webkit-background-clip:text;
    color:transparent;
}

.hero h2{
    margin-top:20px;
    font-size:clamp(20px,3vw,32px);
    font-weight:400;
}

.hero p{
    max-width:700px;
    margin:25px auto;
    color:#8b9b93;
    line-height:1.8;
}

.btn{
    display:inline-block;
    padding:14px 28px;
    border:1px solid #62ffb0;
    color:#62ffb0;
    text-decoration:none;
    border-radius:8px;
    margin:8px;
    transition:.3s;
    background:transparent;
}

.btn:hover{
    background:#62ffb0;
    color:#06100b;
    box-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(98,255,176,.25);
}

section{
    padding:90px 7%;
}

.section-title{
    text-align:center;
    margin-bottom:50px;
}

.section-title h2{
    font-size:38px;
}

.section-title p{
    color:#829189;
    margin-top:10px;
}

.grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));
    gap:20px;
}

.card{
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.025);
    border:1px solid rgba(98,255,176,.14);
    border-radius:18px;
    padding:28px;
    transition:.3s;
}

.card:hover{
    transform:translateY(-6px);
    border-color:#62ffb0;
    box-shadow:0 15px 45px rgba(98,255,176,.07);
}

.icon{
    font-size:32px;
    margin-bottom:18px;
}

.card h3{
    margin-bottom:12px;
}

.card p{
    color:#8b9b93;
    line-height:1.7;
    font-size:14px;
}

.pet{
    max-width:900px;
    margin:auto;
    padding:35px;
    background:rgba(98,255,176,.025);
    border:1px solid rgba(98,255,176,.2);
    border-radius:22px;
}

.pet-top{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);
    padding-bottom:20px;
    margin-bottom:25px;
}

.status{
    color:#62ffb0;
    border:1px solid #62ffb0;
    border-radius:20px;
    padding:6px 12px;
    font-size:12px;
}

.data{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));
    gap:15px;
}

.data-box{
    background:#08120d;
    padding:18px;
    border-radius:12px;
}

.data-box span{
    display:block;
    color:#68766f;
    font-size:11px;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:1px;
    margin-bottom:7px;
}

.data-box strong{
    font-size:16px;
}

.flow{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:15px;
}

.step{
    min-width:150px;
    text-align:center;
    padding:22px;
    border:1px solid rgba(98,255,176,.18);
    border-radius:15px;
}

.step h3{
    color:#62ffb0;
    margin-bottom:8px;
}

.arrow{
    color:#62ffb0;
    font-size:25px;
}

.timeline{
    max-width:900px;
    margin:auto;
}

.timeline-item{
    border-left:2px solid #62ffb0;
    padding:0 0 35px 30px;
    margin-left:10px;
}

.timeline-item h3{
    color:#62ffb0;
    margin-bottom:8px;
}

.timeline-item p{
    color:#8b9b93;
    line-height:1.7;
}

.future{
    border-color:rgba(160,120,255,.3);
}

.future h3{
    color:#c5a8ff;
}

.pet-profile{
    text-align:center;
    margin:30px auto;
}

.pet-avatar{
    width:130px;
    height:130px;
    border-radius:50%;
    border:4px solid #62ffb0;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    margin:auto;
    font-size:60px;
    box-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(98,255,176,.12);
}

.architecture{
    max-width:950px;
    margin:auto;
    text-align:center;
}

.architecture-box{
    padding:25px;
    margin:15px;
    border:1px dashed #62ffb0;
    border-radius:14px;
}

footer{
    text-align:center;
    padding:40px 20px;
    color:#65736c;
    border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
}

footer strong{
    color:#62ffb0;
}

@media(max-width:700px){

    nav div:last-child{
        display:none;
    }

    .hero{
        min-height:80vh;
    }

    section{
        padding:65px 5%;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<nav>

    <div class="logo">PETSAFE</div>

    <div>
        <a href="#identity">Identity</a>
        <a href="#flow">How It Works</a>
        <a href="#future">Future</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
    </div>

</nav>

<header class="hero">

    <div class="hero-content">

        <div class="badge">
            SCIENCE PROJECT • PET SAFETY
        </div>

        <h1>PETSAFE</h1>

        <h2>Smart Digital Pet Safety Identity</h2>

        <p>
            What if a simple pet collar could connect
            a lost pet to a digital identity and help information?
        </p>

        <a href="#identity" class="btn">
            EXPLORE SYSTEM
        </a>

        <a href="#future" class="btn">
            VIEW FUTURE
        </a>

    </div>

</header>

<section id="identity">

    <div class="section-title">

        <h2>Pet Identity Core</h2>

        <p>
            Prototype digital profile connected through a QR tag
        </p>

    </div>

    <div class="pet">

        <div class="pet-top">

            <div>
                <h2>PET IDENTITY PROFILE</h2>
                <p style="color:#68776f;margin-top:5px;">
                    PETSAFE PROTOTYPE
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="status">
                ● PROFILE ACTIVE
            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="pet-profile">

            <div class="pet-avatar">
                🐶
            </div>

            <h2 style="margin-top:20px;">
                MOCHI
            </h2>

            <p style="color:#68776f;margin-top:5px;">
                Fictional demonstration profile
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="data">

            <div class="data-box">
                <span>Pet ID</span>
                <strong>PS-001</strong>
            </div>

            <div class="data-box">
                <span>Pet Type</span>
                <strong>Dog</strong>
            </div>

            <div class="data-box">
                <span>Profile Status</span>
                <strong>Active</strong>
            </div>

            <div class="data-box">
                <span>Owner Contact</span>
                <strong>00000 00000</strong>
            </div>

            <div class="data-box">
                <span>Emergency Contact</span>
                <strong>00000 00000</strong>
            </div>

            <div class="data-box">
                <span>Safety Mode</span>
                <strong>Demo</strong>
            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>

<section id="flow">

    <div class="section-title">

        <h2>How PETSAFE Works</h2>

        <p>
            A simple QR connection between pet and digital profile
        </p>

    </div>

    <div class="flow">

        <div class="step">

            <h3>01</h3>

            <strong>SCAN</strong>

            <p style="color:#819087;margin-top:8px;">
                Scan the QR tag attached to the collar.
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="arrow">→</div>

        <div class="step">

            <h3>02</h3>

            <strong>IDENTIFY</strong>

            <p style="color:#819087;margin-top:8px;">
                Open the pet's digital identity.
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="arrow">→</div>

        <div class="step">

            <h3>03</h3>

            <strong>CONNECT</strong>

            <p style="color:#819087;margin-top:8px;">
                View selected contact and help information.
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="arrow">→</div>

        <div class="step">

            <h3>04</h3>

            <strong>HELP</strong>

            <p style="color:#819087;margin-top:8px;">
                Support reconnecting the pet with its owner.
            </p>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>

<section>

    <div class="section-title">

        <h2>System Architecture</h2>

        <p>
            The physical collar becomes a gateway to a digital identity.
        </p>

    </div>

    <div class="architecture">

        <div class="architecture-box">

            🐕
            <strong>PHYSICAL PET</strong>

            <p>
                Collar + QR Tag
            </p>

        </div>

        <div style="font-size:30px;color:#62ffb0;">
            ↓
        </div>

        <div class="architecture-box">

            🔳
            <strong>QR LAYER</strong>

            <p>
                QR code connects to the pet profile.
            </p>

        </div>

        <div style="font-size:30px;color:#62ffb0;">
            ↓
        </div>

        <div class="architecture-box">

            🌐
            <strong>DIGITAL PROFILE</strong>

            <p>
                Pet identity and selected contact information.
            </p>

        </div>

        <div style="font-size:30px;color:#62ffb0;">
            ↓
        </div>

        <div class="architecture-box">

            🤖
            <strong>FUTURE SAFETY SYSTEM</strong>

            <p>
                GPS + Geofencing + Sensors + AI + Smart Alerts
            </p>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>

<section>

    <div class="section-title">

        <h2>Past → Present → Future</h2>

    </div>

    <div class="timeline">

        <div class="timeline-item">

            <h3>PAST — Simple Collar Identification</h3>

            <p>
                Traditional collars could contain a pet's name
                or a phone number, but information was limited.
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="timeline-item">

            <h3>PRESENT — QR Digital Identity</h3>

            <p>
                PETSAFE adds a QR tag that connects the physical
                collar to a digital pet profile.
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="timeline-item future">

            <h3>FUTURE — Connected Pet Safety</h3>

            <p>
                The concept could evolve through GPS,
                geofencing, activity monitoring, environmental
                sensors, AI-assisted analysis and smart alerts.
            </p>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>

<section id="future">

    <div class="section-title">

        <h2>Future Development</h2>

        <p>
            Possible technologies for a future PETSAFE system
        </p>

    </div>

    <div class="grid">

        <div class="card future">

            <div class="icon">📍</div>

            <h3>GPS Location</h3>

            <p>
                Future versions could integrate location services
                to help locate a pet.
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="card future">

            <div class="icon">🗺️</div>

            <h3>Geofencing</h3>

            <p>
                A future system could define a safe area and
                detect when a pet moves outside it.
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="card future">

            <div class="icon">📊</div>

            <h3>Activity Monitoring</h3>

            <p>
                Sensors could potentially monitor selected
                movement and activity patterns.
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="card future">

            <div class="icon">🌡️</div>

            <h3>Environment Sensors</h3>

            <p>
                Future sensors could monitor environmental
                conditions around the pet.
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="card future">

            <div class="icon">🧠</div>

            <h3>AI Analysis</h3>

            <p>
                AI could potentially analyze activity patterns
                and identify unusual changes.
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="card future">

            <div class="icon">🔔</div>

            <h3>Smart Alerts</h3>

            <p>
                Authorized contacts could receive notifications
                when predefined conditions are detected.
            </p>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>

<section>

    <div class="section-title">

        <h2>Why PETSAFE?</h2>

    </div>

    <div class="grid">

        <div class="card">

            <div class="icon">🔳</div>

            <h3>Simple QR Access</h3>

            <p>
                A QR tag provides a quick bridge between
                a physical pet and digital information.
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="card">

            <div class="icon">🌐</div>

            <h3>Digital Profile</h3>

            <p>
                Information can be organized in one digital
                profile instead of being limited to a small tag.
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="card">

            <div class="icon">❤️</div>

            <h3>Lost-Pet Support</h3>

            <p>
                The concept is designed to make it easier
                for someone who finds a pet to access help information.
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="card">

            <div class="icon">🔐</div>

            <h3>Privacy-Aware</h3>

            <p>
                A real implementation should control what
                information is publicly visible and protect sensitive data.
            </p>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>

<section id="about">

    <div class="section-title">

        <h2>About The Prototype</h2>

    </div>

    <div class="card"
         style="max-width:900px;margin:auto;text-align:center;">

        <p>
            PETSAFE is a science-project prototype demonstrating
            how QR technology can connect a physical pet collar
            with a digital identity.
        </p>

        <br>

        <p>
            The current prototype demonstrates the QR-to-web
            digital identity concept.
        </p>

        <br>

        <p>
            GPS, geofencing, sensors, AI analysis and smart alerts
            are <strong style="color:#62ffb0;">
            future concepts
            </strong>
            and are not active functions of this prototype.
        </p>

        <br>

        <p style="color:#62ffb0;">
            All information shown on this website is fictional.
        </p>

    </div>

</section>

<footer>

    <strong>PETSAFE</strong>

    <br><br>

    Smart Digital Pet Safety Identity

    <br><br>

    Science Project Prototype • Educational Demonstration

</footer>

</body>
</html>
